NOTE ON THE PREVIOUS LICENCE

This repository previously carried an MIT licence. That MIT grant was published
in error: it did not reflect the author's intent to retain commercial and
derivative rights over the research corpus. It is hereby replaced by this dual
licence. Copies previously obtained under MIT remain governed by MIT for those
recipients (an MIT grant, once given for a version, cannot be revoked); all
present and future versions are governed by this dual licence.

